  "text": "Search\nOnboarding checklist\nHide\nTasks\nAutomations\nPorpita Mobile\nNew\nProjects\n0\nNo workspaces found\nPorpita\n\nAdd a project to get started.\n\nAdd project\nCreate workspace\nCreate workspace\nCtrl\n+\nN\nMove up workspace\nCtrl\n+\n⇧\n+\n↑\nMove down workspace\nCtrl\n+\n⇧\n+\n↓\nSelect a workspace to browse files\nOff\n—\n·\n0\nPorpita\nSwitch language\n1 of 6\nWELCOME TO PORPITA\nHow do you want to work with agents?\n\nPick where new agents open.\n\nAdd retry to fetchUser\nEdited\napi.ts\n+1 -1\n12\n-\nreturn fetch(url)\n12\n+\nreturn withRetry(fetch, url)\n\nFailed requests now retry up to 3 times.\n\nAsk a follow-up…\nChat UI\n\nAgents reply in a chat, with rendered messages and diffs.\n\nAgents without chat support, and SSH or WSL projects, still open in a terminal.\n\nzsh — claude\n❯ claude\n> add retry to fetchUser\n● Update(src/api.ts)\n⎿ 1 addition, 1 removal\n12 - return fetch(url)\n12 + return withRetry(fetch, url)\n● Done. Retries capped at 3.\nTerminal\n\nEach agent's own CLI, exactly as it ships. Works with every CLI agent.\n\nNot a permanent choice. Switch any time in Settings → Chat UI.\n\nSet up later\nContinue\nCtrl\n+\nChat or Terminal\nDefault Agent\nAppearance\nIntegrations\nWindows Terminal\nNotifications",
  "dialogs": [
    "Porpita\nSwitch language\n1 of 6\nWELCOME TO PORPITA\nHow do you want to work with agents?\n\nPick where new agents open.\n\nAdd retry to fetchUser\nEdited\napi.ts\n+1 -1\n12\n-\nreturn fetch(url)\n12\n+\nreturn withRetry(fetch, url)\n\nFailed requests now retry up to 3 times.\n\nAsk a follow-up…\nChat UI\n\nAgents reply in a chat, with rendered messages and diffs.\n\nAgents without chat support, and SSH or WSL projects, still open in a terminal.\n\nzsh — claude\n❯ claude\n> add retry to fetchUser\n● Update(src/api.ts)\n⎿ 1 addition, 1 removal\n12 - return fetch(url)\n12 + return withRetry(fetch, url)\n● Done. Retries capped at 3.\nTerminal\n\nEach agent's own CLI, exactly as it ships. Works with every CLI agent.\n\nNot a permanent choice. Switch any time in Settings → Chat UI.\n\nSet up later\nContinue\nCtrl\n+"
